    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but i cant call my doctor right now, it's late and they won't answer. i just don't want to end up in the emergency room if i can just fix it myself. like, if it was high earlier, maybe it's just fluctuating? i dont want to risk it getting way too high while i wait. wouldn't an extra unit help stabilize it so i don't crash too hard later?",
